WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:06.210
Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only astronomical object known to harbor life.

00:06.714 --> 00:14.164
This is made possible by Earth being an ocean world, the only one in the Solar System sustaining liquid surface water.

00:14.659 --> 00:21.179
Almost all of Earth's water is contained in its ocean, which covers 70.8% of Earth's crust.

00:21.852 --> 00:32.037
The remaining 29.2% of Earth's crust is dry land, which is predominantly located within Earth's land hemisphere in the form of continental landmasses.
